\section{Accuracy}{

The inversion computes \eqn{F(y) = 1/2 - I/\pi}{F(y) = 1/2 - I/pi} (and 
\eqn{1 - F(y) = 1/2 + I/\pi}{1 - F(y) = 1/2 + I/pi} for the upper tail), where 
\eqn{I}{I} is the integral evaluated numerically
